      <content textType="caption" fontSize="12" color="rgba(37,99,235,1)" fontFamily="思源黑体" bold="true"><p>第三部分　问题及解决方案</p></content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="80" width="800" height="50">
      <content textType="title" fontSize="26" color="rgba(13,19,38,1)" fontFamily="思源黑体" bold="true"><p>问题四：成片音画不同步、末段黑屏静音</p></content>
    </shape>
    <line startX="80" startY="135" endX="120" endY="135"><border color="rgba(37,99,235,1)" width="3"/></line>
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="155" width="380" height="75" presetHandlers="6">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgba(201,48,44,0.08)"/></fill>
