    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="95" topLeftY="163" width="350" height="22">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13" color="rgba(201,48,44,1)" fontFamily="思源黑体" bold="true"><p>现象</p></content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="95" topLeftY="187" width="350" height="38">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="12" color="rgba(83,97,116,1)" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4"><p>拼接后越到后面越不同步；最后一段黑屏；没有配音的镜头整段静音</p></content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="490" topLeftY="155" width="390" height="75" presetHandlers="6">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgba(13,19,38,0.06)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgba(13,19,38,0.2)" width="1"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="505" topLeftY="163" width="360" height="22">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13" color="rgba(13,19,38,1)" fontFamily="思源黑体" bold="true"><p>根因</p></content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="505" topLeftY="187" width="360" height="38">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="12" color="rgba(83,97,116,1)" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4"><p>多段拼接要求每段时长严格一致。图片没有天然时长、静音没有音轨，不显式补齐就会累积误差</p></content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="250" width="800" height="28">
      <content textType="headline" fontSize="15" color="rgba(13,19,38,1)" fontFamily="思源黑体" bold="true"><p>四步方案 —— 每段素材进拼接前必须被规整到完全等长</p></content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="285" width="190" height="100" presetHandlers="4">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgba(37,99,235,0.1)"/></fill>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="95" topLeftY="293" width="160" height="22">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="12" color="rgba(37,99,235,1)" fontFamily="思源黑体" bold="true"><p>规格统一</p></content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="95" topLeftY="318" width="160" height="60">
      <content textType="caption" fontSize="10" color="rgba(83,97,116,1)" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3"><p>统一 1080×1920 / 30fps / yuv420p；scale + pad 归一并防变形</p></content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="285" topLeftY="285" width="190" height="100" presetHandlers="4">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgba(37,99,235,0.12)"/></fill>
