    <shape type="text" topLeftX="300" topLeftY="293" width="160" height="22">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="12" color="rgba(37,99,235,1)" fontFamily="思源黑体" bold="true"><p>视频对齐</p></content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="300" topLeftY="318" width="160" height="60">
      <content textType="caption" fontSize="10" color="rgba(83,97,116,1)" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3"><p>末帧克隆（tpad）+ 精确裁剪（trim），把每段拉到与时间线严格一致</p></content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="490" topLeftY="285" width="190" height="100" presetHandlers="4">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgba(37,99,235,0.14)"/></fill>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="505" topLeftY="293" width="160" height="22">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="12" color="rgba(37,99,235,1)" fontFamily="思源黑体" bold="true"><p>音频对齐</p></content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="505" topLeftY="318" width="160" height="60">
      <content textType="caption" fontSize="10" color="rgba(83,97,116,1)" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3"><p>补静音（apad）+ 裁剪对齐（atrim）；无音轨段落生成静音底，避免整段无声</p></content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="695" topLeftY="285" width="185" height="100" presetHandlers="4">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgba(13,19,38,1)"/></fill>
