    <shape type="text" topLeftX="710" topLeftY="293" width="155" height="22">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="12" color="rgba(255,255,255,1)" fontFamily="思源黑体" bold="true"><p>预检机制</p></content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="710" topLeftY="318" width="155" height="60">
      <content textType="caption" fontSize="10" color="rgba(191,215,255,1)" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3"><p>合成前返回"缺视频镜头清单"，点名提示会跳过哪几幕，而不是失败后才报错</p></content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="405" width="800" height="95" presetHandlers="6">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgba(13,19,38,1)"/></fill>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="100" topLeftY="418" width="760" height="28">
      <content textType="headline" fontSize="16" color="rgba(255,255,255,1)" fontFamily="思源黑体" bold="true"><p>效果与教训</p></content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="100" topLeftY="450" width="760" height="42">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13" color="rgba(191,215,255,1)" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5">
        <p>成片不再出现音画漂移与黑屏，合成成功率稳定。最大的教训：多个片段拼接，时长只要差一点，误差就会累积 —— 所以每段素材进拼接前必须被规整到完全等长。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
